<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16131" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσέβ-εια</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ungodliness, impiety,</i> opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδικία, διὰ τὴν ἐκείνων περὶ μὲν
					θεοὺς ἀ. περὶ δὲ ἀνθρώπους ἀδικίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					8.8.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. εἰς τοὺς θεούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					5.88
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				615c
			</span></i>, etc.; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἀπὸ τοῦ θεοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>2 Ki.</u>
					22.22
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἀσκεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					476
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκη ἀσεβείας πρὸς τὸν βασιλέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					6.11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσεβείας γράφεσθαί τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Euthphr.</u>
					5c
				</span></i>
			: at Rome, <i>disloyalty to the Emperor</i> (as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεός</span>), <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				57.9
			</span></i>; of Christianity, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				68.1
			</span></i>: in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσέβειαι ἀνθρώποις ἐμπίπτουσι νέοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					890a
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
